This License shall be governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of [JURISDICTION] (to be determined by Ryn Corporation), without regard to conflict of law principles. Any disputes arising from this License shall first be subject to good-faith settlement through negotiation. In the event of non-resolution, disputes shall be submitted to binding arbitration or mediation at the discretion of Ryn Corporation.

